enchants.tooltip:
Teaches you: Rain of Arrows. 
Rain of Arrows: Continuously fires a volley of ammo at the target area, causing 34 Arcane damage to enemy targets within 8 yards every second for 6 sec.

@ext:Scales with Volley modifiers.:ext@

Teaches you: Powershot. 
Powershot: You wind up a powerful shot, which deals 250% weapon damage to the target and all enemies in between you and the target. Your attacks bypass 30% armor for 10 sec on enemies and they are also knocked back.

@ext:Powershot can benefit from Piercing Shots, Improved Steady Shot, Barrage and Improved Barrage talents.:ext@

Teaches you: Stampede. 
Stampede: Summon a herd of stampeding animals from the wilds that deals 1184.92 Physical damage to your enemies over 6 sec. The animals run up to 30 yards in front of you.

Enemies struck by the stampede take increased damage from you and your pet by 5% for 20 sec, stacking to 4. Enemies movement speed are also reduced by 50% for 3 sec.

@ext:Damage is increased by 50% if Bestial Wrath is active on your pet.:ext@

@ext:The cooldown of Stampede is reduced by the Longevity talent.:ext@

Teaches you: Aimed Shot.

@ext:Can not be used if the Aimed Shot talent is learned.:ext@
