Launch Shadow Artillery at the target's location, dealing 426 Shadow damage and an additional 161 Shadow damage every second to nearby enemies for 3 sec. Restores 35% of your base mana upon casting.

Max 1 charges. 45 second recharge timer. Consumes 3 Shadow Shells instead of charges.

@ext:Benefits from the Molten Core talent. Damage is split when hitting more than 5 targets.:ext@
